	(text "Vin+ and Vout+ are shorted via the sense resistor. This means\nthat VIN+ and VOUT+ are always at 12V+ because of the J10-J9 bridge.\nThis means that it is hard to check when current is flowing/not flowing\nthrough the LPS."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.528 41.402 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
				(color 194 0 0 1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "7feb6210-a850-4435-8366-211c1ecdfc19")
	)
	(text "In position 1. \nThe 12V+ will go into connector 1 of the LPS-1\nThe 12V Load will pass though to the common on the fuse block.\n\nIn position 2.\nNo 12V+ will be available to neither the LPS-1 unit nor the \ncommon of the fuse block. i.e. the system will be shut down except for the \nsolar pannel and the charging unit.\n\nIn Position 3.\nThe 12V+ will be directed to the common on the fuse block and\nthe LPS-1 will be removed from the system."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 187.198 64.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "8e0393af-4fad-40d6-bf37-cfcba9a3fcf1")
	)
	(text "Solar charging unit\n        + -    + -"
